message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "TE3 Engine: Techno-Economic Evaluation Engine"
abstract: >-
  TE3 Engine is a Streamlit screening tool for municipal solar photovoltaic
  and battery energy storage investments in New York State. From a ZIP code,
  a facility type and a solar array size, it estimates annual solar
  generation, savings by revenue stream, net capital cost, simple payback and
  indicative backup duration, and exports a four page pre-feasibility
  screening report.
